Z||000003||Tigger||02-18-2001||08:14 PM||||I grew up watching Dale Earnhart Sr. race, I seen him finally win a Daytona 500 a couple years ago, I watched him just two weeks ago race in the 24 hours of Daytona, and today I hold back the tears of knowing that I had just watched him race his final race today. He did something, I know he truly believed in, but most importantly something he loved to do.<BR>This news hits me hard as Dale was my favorite race car driver.<P>My deepest prayers and condolences go out to the Earnhart family.<BR>||||reg||9
