Z||000009||RaeQwan||02-19-2001||02:04 PM||||he died doing what he loved to do. thats more than alot of ppl get. Now he's racin with Alan & Neil.. <P>We'll miss Dale, but know he's somewhere giving other drivers some but kickin.<P>------------------<BR>Ray - AIM: WookieeNC<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ray19nc/" TARGET=_blank>1988 Fiero Coupe</A> - <A HREF="http://www.CarolinaFieros.com" TARGET=_blank>Carolina Fieros</A> - <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/dearabu/" TARGET=_blank>Dear Abu</A> - <A HREF="http://www.webjolt.net" TARGET=_blank>WebJolt Network</A>||||reg||1
Z||000010||Randy Chavis||02-19-2001||03:28 PM||||He was Nascar...I also remember my dad racing with his dad here in Columbia,SC at the old Columbia Speedway..Dale was like his dad..if he saw anything that looked like a opening he would go for it..I also wanted to race but never got the chance to do it. I turned 50 in January and I got a gift that I have always wanted and that is to drive a race car. I will do this a Lowes Motor Speedway and it will mean more to me than anything after this has happened..you can bet the 30 laps I will get to run i will be thinking of MY dad and of Dale..<BR>  We will miss the greatest race car drive ever to me....God Bless his family and all his fans...<P>          randy<P>------------------<BR>85 SE V6 4 speed<BR>85 SE V6 auto<BR>86 GT V6 4 speed<BR>86 GT V6  auto<BR>87 GT V6 5 speed||||reg||9
Z||000011||Coconut||02-19-2001||03:38 PM||||Very sad news indeed  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> The racing community has lost a true representative of the sport. I felt equally saddened by the passing of Greg Moore (CART) as well. Thoughts and prayers go out to Mr. Earnhardt's family and friends.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Coconut's_Signature_1.JPG"> ||||reg||9
Z||000012||RaeQwan||02-19-2001||04:18 PM||||Not only has the racing community lost a great driver, But the entire family of drivers of Winston Cup, BGN, Iroc and other racing series have lost a great friend.<P>As on Saga in the Winston Cup ends, another begins.. the Earnhardt name will wear the title Winston Cup Champion in 2001. <P>Go Lil E, Win it for em.<BR>------------------<BR>Ray - AIM: WookieeNC<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ray19nc/" TARGET=_blank>1988 Fiero Coupe</A> - <A HREF="http://www.CarolinaFieros.com" TARGET=_blank>Carolina Fieros</A> - <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/dearabu/" TARGET=_blank>Dear Abu</A> - <A HREF="http://www.webjolt.net" TARGET=_blank>WebJolt Network</A><p>[This message has been edited by RaeQwan (edited 02-19-2001).]||||reg||1
